# What the api container reads. Nothing here is a value you set by hand on the VPS.
#
# 1. api-public.conf (committed) holds the non-secret production configuration.
# 2. Every secret is sealed in .starcistacks/production/secrets/{api,auth}.enc (plus OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN / OPENCLAW_MANAGE_AGENTS from
#    stack.enc). The deploy writes one file per key to ./secrets/api and generates api.env with `<KEY>_FILE=/run/secrets/<KEY>` pointer lines;
#    the be reads each key through EnvSource (a declared `<KEY>_FILE` wins).
# Set a sealed value with `starci app secret set production api --key <KEY>`. A missing REQUIRED key stops the process at boot with its name.
#
# Names only below. R = required at boot, O = optional (the capability is off when its group is incomplete).
#
# ---- core (R)
# PRIMARY_DB_URL          (R, secret) postgresql://app_be.<ref>:...@<session pooler>:5432/postgres, produced by the cutover owner scripts
# PRIMARY_DB_SCHEMA       (R) public                       api-public.conf
# SUPABASE_URL            (R) the Supabase project origin
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY (R, secret) Auth and Storage administration only
# HTTP_SECURITY_ALLOWED_ORIGINS (R) https://nivo.vn,https://www.nivo.vn   api-public.conf
# HTTP_SECURITY_TRUSTED_PROXY_HOPS (0..2, default 1) trusted proxy hops before the API
# SITE_URL                (R) https://nivo.vn              api-public.conf
# PUBLIC_SITE_URL         https://nivo.vn   api-public.conf
# PUBLIC_API_URL          https://api.nivo.vn   api-public.conf
# CHANNEL_TOKEN_KEY       (R, secret) encrypts stored channel tokens
# N8N_SIGNING_SECRET      (R, secret) must equal what the n8n workflows sign with
# N8N_WEBHOOK_BASE        (R) http://n8n:5678/webhook/nivo-events   api-public.conf
# WEBHOOK_SIGNING_SECRET  (O, secret) root of the per-workspace signing keys of customer outbound webhooks; absent = signing unavailable
#
# ---- OpenClaw (O): OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_URL is set by docker-compose.yml
# OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN, OPENCLAW_TOOL_SECRET, OPENCLAW_MANAGE_AGENTS (true|false), OPENCLAW_TURN_TIMEOUT (duration, default 90s)
#
# ---- providers (O)
# META_APP_ID, META_APP_SECRET, META_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN (all three or none); optional META_GRAPH_VERSION, META_LOGIN_CONFIG_ID, META_SEND_PER_MINUTE, META_TIMEOUT
# SEPAY_WEBHOOK_API_KEY, SEPAY_BANK_ACCOUNT, SEPAY_BANK_CODE, SEPAY_ACCOUNT_NAME (all four or none); BANK_WEBHOOK_SECRET
# SMTP_URL, SMTP_FROM; GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID / GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET (fallback: SUPABASE_AUTH_EXTERNAL_GOOGLE_*)
# Model keys: OPENROUTER_API_KEY, DEEPSEEK_API_KEY, LLM_API_KEY, EMBEDDING_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY; LLM_BASE_URL, LLM_MODEL
# NIVO_PLATFORM_ADMINS, WORKSPACE_SIGNUP_ENABLED (true|false)
#
# ---- queues and jobs (tunables with literal defaults in the code)
# QUEUE_ENABLED, QUEUE_CONCURRENCY, QUEUE_WORKSPACE_CONCURRENCY, QUEUE_POLL_INTERVAL, QUEUE_VISIBILITY_TIMEOUT, QUEUE_SHUTDOWN_GRACE, JOBS_LEASE, JOBS_WORKER_ID
